Package: flusurvey
Type: Package
Title: Packages for analysing flusurvey data
Version: 1.0
Date: 2015-10-27
Author: Sebastian Funk
Maintainer: Sebastian Funk <sebastian.funk@lshtm.ac.uk>
Description: Functions for reading, cleaning and linking the questionnaire
    responses of FluSurvey, the UK online cohort survey of influenza-like
    illness, and for estimating incidence and episodes of illness from them.
License: GPL-2
URL: https://sbfnk.github.io/flusurvey/, https://github.com/sbfnk/flusurvey
BugReports: https://github.com/sbfnk/flusurvey/issues
